  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………小糸、ごめんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040010,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………な、なんで\r\nプロデューサーさんが、謝るんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "022",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんは\r\n悪くないじゃないですか…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "違うんだ、小糸\r\nごめんな、俺、知ってたのに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もしかしたら小糸は、頑張ってるところ見られるの\r\nあまり好きじゃないのかもしれないって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺は、それを\r\nこっそり教えてもらってたのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸がもっといろんな仕事に挑戦したいって\r\n思ってることも、わかってたつもりで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00432",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのために、どうしたらいいかって考えていくうちに……\r\n小糸が望まない方法を取って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……小糸の気持ちを、ないがしろにしてしまった\r\nそれは、一番やってはいけないことだったのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00070",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんは\r\nわ、わたしのために、考えてやってくれたんですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "065",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それは、そうなんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、もっと何か\r\n別の方法を考えるべきだったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "電話で、小糸の言葉を聞くまで\r\nそのことに気が付けもしなかった……ごめん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "い、いえ……あの…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040050"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "じ、自分でも、わかってます\r\n……わたしが、アイドルをやっていくなら",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "『頑張ってる』ってところを見せて、\r\n応援してもらわないといけないんじゃないかって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そんなこと──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だ、だって……わたし、\r\nなんの結果も、出してないです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "オーディションも……ほとんど受からない\r\nユニット活動以外はほとんど、お仕事もしてないし",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "お、応援するきっかけも、魅力も、\r\nないじゃないですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはない\r\nきっかけは、これからどんどん増えていくし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうしていくのが、俺の仕事なんだ\r\nそうしなきゃいけない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』だって、その\r\nきっかけのひとつで──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だ、だから、プロデューサーさんがやってくれた……\r\nSNSの投稿とかが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしが、アイドルをやっていくのに\r\n必要なことだったって……わたしも、思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ど、どんな形だって、応援してもらえるのは\r\nすごく、ありがたいことだし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "じ、自分以外の人だって、当然、努力してて……\r\nたくさん、辛いことがあるのかもしれないって",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そういうことを、抱えて、向き合ってるんだって",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……ちょっとだけですけど、\r\nそれが、わかったような気がして",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………\r\nしてたのに……やっぱり…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わたしは……下手くそでかっこ悪いところを\r\n全部、みんなにさらけ出して",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それでもこんなに頑張ってるんだって、\r\n……それが、わたしの良いところなんだって",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そういうことを、ステージで言えるほど\r\nまだ……強くは、なれそうにないんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……ごめんな\r\nそれから、教えてくれてありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当はもっと早く、こうやって\r\n話をしなきゃいけなかったよな",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸のことをしっかりサポートしていきたいって\r\n気持ちに、変わりはない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからも、\r\n俺にできることはなんでもするつもりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、俺がちゃんと小糸をサポートできるように\r\n小糸に、手伝ってほしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………それって\r\nわたしのサポートの、サポートじゃないですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、うん、ごめん\r\nそうなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もし、サポートのサポートの、\r\nそのまたサポートが要る時も、教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一緒に、頑張っていくって\r\n多分、そういうことだったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200304/1022003040240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1022003040250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……うん\r\nそうかもしれないです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
